  <entity00164779:ExchangeSubjectBondsIssuedOfDisclosureOfConditionsForTheIssuanceOfExchangeableBondLineItemsOfDisclosureOfConditionsForTheIssuanceOfExchangeableBondTableTableOfItems contextRef="CFY2024dFY_ifrs-full_ConsolidatedAndSeparateFinancialStatementsAxis_ifrs-full_ConsolidatedMember_ifrs-full_BorrowingsByNameAxis_entity00164779_GlobalExchangeableBondInForeignCurrencyMemberOfBorrowingsByNameMemberOfDisclosureOfConditionsForTheIssuanceOfExchangeableBondTableTableOfMember" xml:lang="ko">SK하이닉스 주식회사 발행 기명식 보통 주식(자기주식)</entity00164779:ExchangeSubjectBondsIssuedOfDisclosureOfConditionsForTheIssuanceOfExchangeableBondLineItemsOfDisclosureOfConditionsForTheIssuanceOfExchangeableBondTableTableOfItems>
